In particular, the C&MD Committee noted that (i) FW Cook provided no other services to the Company; and (ii) FW Cook’s work is performed directly on behalf of the Board working in cooperation with management, to assist both the C&MD Committee and the Governance Committee, as applicable, with executing their respective responsibilities.

Services Performed During 2025

During 2025, FW Cook supported the C&MD Committee in the following areas:

•

Competitive market data with respect to the compensation of the CEO and other senior executives;

•

Guidance and analysis on executive compensation plan design, market trends, regulatory developments, and best practices;

•

Design and setting of performance goals in the variable incentive plans;

•

Target TDC and payouts under the Executive Incentive Plan for the CEO;

